A8  The negation isomorphism nu(r) = -r between the plus and minus automata
==============================================================================
  For k = 1..12 the bijection r -> -r mod 3*2^k maps every D- and E_+-edge of the plus automaton
  onto a D- resp. E_- -edge of the minus automaton (guard 2 mod 3 <-> 1 mod 3), and T_-(-n) = -T_+(n).
  Root types: {1,2} (plus) <-> {-1,-2} (the minus sheet's NEGATIVE cycle); the minus sheet's positive
  fixed point 1 <-> the plus type -1, i.e. the E_+-fixed point.

