N_d(a) = number of depth-d T-predecessors of a (words in D, E legal at a).  Legality is 3-adic only;
N_d is a function of a mod 3^d:  N_d(a) = N_(d-1)(2a) + [a = 2 mod 3] N_(d-1)((2a-1)/3).

